      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm working on my thesis for my International Relations seminar and I'm stuck on the framework. When analyzing US border policy, how do you weigh the tension between the state's requirement for national sovereignty and the international legal frameworks regarding humanitarian obligations and migrant rights? Which of these should arguably take precedence in a modern geopolitical context?",
